// spec: type-system.md §9/§15 — a `dyn Eq` value dispatches .eq
// virtually, exactly like any trait method (there is no separate
// dyn mechanism for operators); the == operator itself still never
// applies to dyn. Promotion note: `other: Self` read as dyn Eq at
